Speech to Text — release signing key(s)
=======================================

This file must contain the ASCII-armored GPG public key used to sign release
checksum manifests (`SHA256SUMS.asc`). Import it with:

    gpg --import KEYS

and verify a download with `scripts/verify-release.sh`.

No public signing key has been published yet. There is no automated release
workflow. Publish only the public key and its fingerprint here before offering
signed checksum manifests; never commit the private key or signing credentials.
